<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0a0e27">
    <title>Quốc Huy | Uniform Designer & UX/UI Developer</title>
    
    <!-- Google Fonts -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        /* ============================================================
           DESIGN SYSTEM - PREMIUM DARK LUXURY FOR UNIFORM DESIGNER
           ============================================================ */
        
        :root {
            /* ========== LIGHT MODE (DEFAULT) ========== */
            --bg-primary: #ffffff;
            --bg-secondary: #f5f7ff;
            --bg-tertiary: #eef3f7;
            --bg-light: #dfebf5;
            
            /* ========== NEON ACCENTS ========== */
            --accent-cyan: #00d9ff;
            --accent-pink: #ff006e;
            --accent-purple: #8000ff;
            --accent-gold: #ffd700;
            --accent-blue: #0066ff;
            
            /* ========== TEXT COLORS ========== */
            --text-primary: #0a0e27;
            --text-secondary: #4a5568;
            --text-tertiary: #7a8896;
            
            /* ========== GLASS EFFECT ========== */
            --glass-light: rgba(0, 217, 255, 0.05);
            --glass-border: rgba(0, 217, 255, 0.1);
            
            /* ========== SHADOWS & EFFECTS ========== */
            --shadow-sm: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 14, 39, 0.05);
            --shadow-md: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 14, 39, 0.08);
            --shadow-lg: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 14, 39, 0.12);
            --glow-cyan: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 217, 255, 0.2);
            --glow-pink: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 0, 110, 0.2);
            --glow-gold: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.2);
            
            /* ========== TRANSITIONS ========== */
            --transition-fast: 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94);
            --transition-normal: 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94);
            --transition-slow: 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94);
        }

        /* Dark mode overrides */
        [data-theme="dark"] {
            --bg-primary: #0a0e27;
            --bg-secondary: #151a3f;
            --bg-tertiary: #1f2650;
            --bg-light: #2a2f4d;
            --text-primary: #ffffff;
            --text-secondary: #b8c5d6;
            --text-tertiary: #7a8896;
            --glass-light: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            --glass-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            --shadow-sm: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 217, 255, 0.05);
            --shadow-md: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 217, 255, 0.08);
            --shadow-lg: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 217, 255, 0.12);
            --glow-cyan: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 217, 255, 0.3);
            --glow-pink: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 0, 110, 0.3);
            --glow-gold: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.3);
        }

        /* ============================================================
           GLOBAL STYLES
           ============================================================ */
        
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            transition: background-color 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
            background: var(--bg-primary);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            line-height: 1.6;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            transition: background 0.3s var(--transition-normal);
        }

        /* Scroll Progress Bar */
        ::before {
            content: '';
        }

        body::before {
            content: '';
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            height: 3px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent-cyan), var(--accent-gold), var(--accent-pink));
            width: var(--scroll-progress, 0%);
            z-index: 2000;
            transition: width 0.1s linear;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 2rem;
        }

        a {
            color: inherit;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all var(--transition-normal);
        }

        /* Button utility */
        .btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.6rem;
            padding: 0.9rem 1.8rem;
            border: 2px solid transparent;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all var(--transition-fast);
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-cyan), var(--accent-purple));
            color: var(--bg-primary);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .btn::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-gold), var(--accent-cyan));
            opacity: 0;
            transition: opacity var(--transition-fast);
            z-index: -1;
        }

        .btn:hover::before {
            opacity: 1;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: var(--glow-cyan);
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            background: var(--glass-light);
            border: 2px solid var(--glass-border);
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
        }

        .btn-secondary:hover {
            background: var(--accent-cyan);
            border-color: var(--accent-cyan);
            color: var(--bg-primary);
        }

        /* ============================================================
           ANIMATIONS
           ============================================================ */
        
        @keyframes fadeInUp {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(40px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        @keyframes fadeInDown {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(-40px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        @keyframes slideInLeft {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateX(-60px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateX(0);
            }
        }

        @keyframes slideInRight {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateX(60px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateX(0);
            }
        }

        @keyframes float {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-20px); }
        }

        @keyframes floatSlow {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-30px); }
        }

        @keyframes pulse {
            0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
            50% { opacity: 0.5; }
        }

        @keyframes glow {
            0%, 100% { box-shadow: var(--glow-cyan); }
            50% { box-shadow: var(--glow-gold); }
        }

        @keyframes rotateBg {
            0% { transform: rotate(0deg); }
            100% { transform: rotate(360deg); }
        }

        @keyframes blobShape1 {
            0%, 100% { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1); }
            33% { transform: translate(20px, -30px) scale(1.1); }
            66% { transform: translate(-20px, 20px) scale(0.9); }
        }

        @keyframes blobShape2 {
            0%, 100% { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1); }
            33% { transform: translate(-30px, 20px) scale(0.9); }
            66% { transform: translate(30px, -20px) scale(1.1); }
        }

        @keyframes particleFloat {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px) rotate(0deg); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-10px) rotate(180deg); }
        }

        /* Reveal animation for scroll */
        .reveal {
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(60px);
        }

        .reveal.active {
            animation: fadeInUp 0.8s var(--transition-slow) forwards;
        }

        /* ============================================================
           BACKGROUND BLOBS & PARTICLES
           ============================================================ */
        
        .blob-decoration {
            position: fixed;
            border-radius: 50%;
            opacity: 0.1;
            z-index: 1;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .blob-1 {
            width: 600px;
            height: 600px;
            top: -200px;
            right: -100px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-cyan), var(--accent-purple));
            animation: blobShape1 15s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        .blob-2 {
            width: 500px;
            height: 500px;
            bottom: 100px;
            left: -150px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-gold), var(--accent-pink));
            animation: blobShape2 18s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        .particles {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .particle {
            position: absolute;
            width: 4px;
            height: 4px;
            background: var(--accent-cyan);
            border-radius: 50%;
            animation: particleFloat 6s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        .particle:nth-child(2n) {
            background: var(--accent-gold);
            animation-delay: 1s;
        }

        .particle:nth-child(3n) {
            background: var(--accent-pink);
            animation-delay: 2s;
        }

        /* ============================================================
           HEADER & NAVIGATION
           ============================================================ */
        
        header {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 1.2rem 0;
            background: rgba(245, 247, 255, 0.7);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 217, 255, 0.1);
            z-index: 1000;
            transition: all var(--transition-normal);
        }

        [data-theme="dark"] header {
            background: rgba(10, 14, 39, 0.7);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
        }

        header.scrolled {
            padding: 0.8rem 0;
            background: rgba(245, 247, 255, 0.95);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 14, 39, 0.08);
        }

        [data-theme="dark"] header.scrolled {
            background: rgba(10, 14, 39, 0.95);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
        }

        nav {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -2px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-cyan), var(--accent-gold));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
            font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            list-style: none;
            gap: 2.5rem;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            position: relative;
            padding: 0.5rem 0;
        }

        .nav-links a::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 0;
            height: 2px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent-cyan), var(--accent-gold));
            transition: width var(--transition-fast);
        }

        .nav-links a.active::before,
        .nav-links a:hover::before {
            width: 100%;
        }

        .nav-controls {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1.5rem;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .theme-toggle {
            width: 44px;
            height: 44px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--glass-light);
            border: 2px solid var(--glass-border);
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            transition: all var(--transition-fast);
        }

        .theme-toggle:hover {
            background: var(--accent-cyan);
            border-color: var(--accent-cyan);
            color: var(--bg-primary);
            box-shadow: var(--glow-cyan);
        }

        .hamburger {
            display: none;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 6px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .hamburger span {
            width: 24px;
            height: 2.5px;
            background: var(--text-primary);
            border-radius: 2px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        /* ============================================================
           HERO SECTION - UNIFORM DESIGNER FOCUS
           ============================================================ */
        
        .hero {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 4rem;
            align-items: center;
            justify-items: center;
            padding: 120px 0 80px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .hero::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 50%, rgba(0, 217, 255, 0.1) 0%, transparent 50%);
            z-index: -1;
        }

        .hero-content {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 2rem;
            animation: slideInLeft 1s var(--transition-slow);
        }

        .hero-subtitle {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.8rem;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .hero-subtitle::before {
            content: '';
            width: 12px;
            height: 12px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--accent-cyan);
            animation: pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        .hero-title {
            font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            line-height: 1.2;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -2px;
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }

        .hero-title .highlight {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-cyan), var(--accent-gold), var(--accent-pink));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
        }

        .hero-description {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            line-height: 1.8;
            max-width: 600px;
        }

        .hero-cta {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-top: 1rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .hero-visual {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            position: relative;
            animation: slideInRight 1s var(--transition-slow);
        }

        .hero-card {
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 400px;
            aspect-ratio: 1;
            border-radius: 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--glass-light), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02));
            border: 2px solid var(--glass-border);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 8rem;
            animation: float 4s ease-in-out infinite;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
        }

        .hero-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            inset: -2px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 2px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-cyan), var(--accent-gold), var(--accent-pink));
            -webkit-mask: linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box, linear-gradient(#fff 0 0);
            -webkit-mask-composite: xor;
            mask-composite: exclude;
            opacity: 0;
            animation: pulse 3s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        .hero-card:hover {
            box-shadow: var(--glow-cyan);
            border-color: var(--accent-cyan);
        }

        /* Floating elements */
        .floating-shape {
            position: absolute;
            border-radius: 50%;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .shape-1 {
            width: 100px;
            height: 100px;
            top: 20%;
            right: 10%;
            background: rgba(0, 217, 255, 0.1);
            animation: float 5s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        .shape-2 {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            bottom: 15%;
            left: 20%;
            background: rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.1);
            animation: floatSlow 6s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        /* Stats cards */
        .hero-stats {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-top: 2rem;
        }

        .stat {
            padding: 1.2rem;
            background: var(--glass-light);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            transition: all var(--transition-fast);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .stat:hover {
            background: rgba(0, 217, 255, 0.1);
            border-color: var(--accent-cyan);
            box-shadow: var(--glow-cyan);
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        .stat-number {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
        }

        .stat-label {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-tertiary);
        }

        /* ============================================================
           SECTIONS
           ============================================================ */
        
        section {
            padding: 100px 0;
            position: relative;
        }

        section.dark-section {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-secondary) 0%, var(--bg-tertiary) 100%);
        }

        .section-header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 4rem;
        }

        .section-label {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.6rem;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .section-label::before {
            content: '';
            width: 10px;
            height: 10px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--accent-cyan);
        }

        .section-title {
            font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
            font-size: 3rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1.2;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .section-description {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        /* ============================================================
           ABOUT SECTION
           ============================================================ */
        
        .about-content {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 4rem;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .about-text {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }

        .about-text h3 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }

        .about-text p {
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .about-skills {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }

        .skill-tag {
            padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem;
            background: var(--glass-light);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            transition: all var(--transition-fast);
        }

        .skill-tag:hover {
            background: var(--accent-cyan);
            color: var(--bg-primary);
            box-shadow: var(--glow-cyan);
        }

        .about-image {
            width: 100%;
            aspect-ratio: 1;
            border-radius: 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 217, 255, 0.1), rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.1));
            border: 2px solid var(--glass-border);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 6rem;
            animation: float 4s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        /* ============================================================
           SKILLS SECTION - DESIGNER FOCUSED
           ============================================================ */
        
        .skills-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .skill-card {
            padding: 2rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--glass-light), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02));
            border: 2px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 16px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            text-align: center;
            transition: all var(--transition-fast);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .skill-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 217, 255, 0.15), rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.15));
            opacity: 0;
            transition: opacity var(--transition-fast);
            z-index: -1;
        }

        .skill-card:hover::before {
            opacity: 1;
        }

        .skill-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-12px);
            border-color: var(--accent-cyan);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg), var(--glow-cyan);
        }

        .skill-icon {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            display: block;
        }

        .skill-name {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .skill-desc {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* ============================================================
           UNIFORM DESIGN PROJECTS
           ============================================================ */
        
        .uniform-projects-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(350px, 1fr));
            gap: 2.5rem;
        }

        .uniform-project-card {
            height: 100%;
            border-radius: 16px;
            overflow: hidden;
            background: var(--bg-light);
            border: 2px solid var(--glass-border);
            transition: all var(--transition-normal);
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            position: relative;
            group: 1;
        }

        .uniform-project-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 217, 255, 0.2), rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.2));
            opacity: 0;
            transition: opacity var(--transition-normal);
            z-index: 10;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .uniform-project-card:hover::before {
            opacity: 1;
        }

        .uniform-project-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-20px);
            border-color: var(--accent-cyan);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg), var(--glow-cyan);
        }

        .uniform-project-image {
            width: 100%;
            height: 280px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 217, 255, 0.1), rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.1));
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 5rem;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .uniform-project-image::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 217, 255, 0.2), transparent);
            opacity: 0;
            transition: opacity var(--transition-normal);
        }

        .uniform-project-card:hover .uniform-project-image::before {
            opacity: 1;
        }

        .uniform-project-content {
            padding: 2rem;
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .uniform-project-title {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            line-height: 1.3;
        }

        .uniform-project-desc {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            line-height: 1.6;
            flex-grow: 1;
        }

        .uniform-project-tags {
            display: flex;
            gap: 0.6rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }

        .uniform-project-tag {
            padding: 0.4rem 0.9rem;
            background: var(--glass-light);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: all var(--transition-fast);
        }

        .uniform-project-tag:hover {
            background: var(--accent-cyan);
            color: var(--bg-primary);
            border-color: var(--accent-cyan);
        }

        .uniform-project-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }

        .uniform-project-link {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 0.7rem;
            background: var(--glass-light);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            transition: all var(--transition-fast);
        }

        .uniform-project-link:hover {
            background: var(--accent-cyan);
            color: var(--bg-primary);
            border-color: var(--accent-cyan);
        }

        /* ============================================================
           UX/UI PROJECTS
           ============================================================ */
        
        .ui-projects-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .ui-project-card {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--glass-light), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03));
            border: 2px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 20px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(25px);
            transition: all var(--transition-normal);
            cursor: pointer;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            padding: 0;
            height: 400px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .ui-project-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 217, 255, 0.1), rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.1), rgba(255, 0, 110, 0.1));
            opacity: 0;
            transition: opacity var(--transition-normal);
            z-index: 1;
            border-radius: 20px;
        }

        .ui-project-card::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-cyan), var(--accent-gold), var(--accent-pink));
            opacity: 0;
            transition: opacity var(--transition-normal);
            z-index: 2;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 2px;
            mask: linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box, linear-gradient(#fff 0 0);
            mask-composite: exclude;
        }

        .ui-project-card:hover::before {
            opacity: 1;
        }

        .ui-project-card:hover::after {
            opacity: 1;
        }

        .ui-project-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-20px) scale(1.02);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg), 0 0 40px rgba(0, 217, 255, 0.2);
        }

        .ui-project-image {
            width: 100%;
            height: 240px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 217, 255, 0.1), rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.1));
            border-radius: 18px 18px 0 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 4rem;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: all var(--transition-normal);
        }

        .ui-project-image::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 217, 255, 0.3), rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.3));
            opacity: 0;
            transition: opacity var(--transition-normal);
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .ui-project-card:hover .ui-project-image {
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }

        .ui-project-card:hover .ui-project-image::before {
            opacity: 1;
        }

        .ui-project-content {
            padding: 1.5rem;
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 3;
        }

        .ui-project-title {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }

        .ui-project-desc {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
            flex: 1;
        }

        .ui-project-tags {
            display: flex;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .ui-project-tag {
            padding: 0.4rem 0.9rem;
            background: var(--glass-light);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 25px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: all var(--transition-fast);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }

        .ui-project-card:hover .ui-project-tag {
            background: var(--accent-cyan);
            color: var(--bg-primary);
            border-color: var(--accent-cyan);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }
        }

        .ui-project-tag:hover {
            background: var(--accent-gold);
            color: var(--bg-primary);
            border-color: var(--accent-gold);
        }

        /* ============================================================
           EXPERIENCE TIMELINE
           ============================================================ */
        
        .timeline {
            position: relative;
            padding: 2rem 0;
        }

        .timeline::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            width: 2px;
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--accent-cyan), var(--accent-gold));
        }

        .timeline-items {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 3rem;
        }

        .timeline-item {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 2rem;
            position: relative;
        }

        .timeline-item:nth-child(even) {
            direction: rtl;
        }

        .timeline-item:nth-child(even) > * {
            direction: ltr;
        }

        .timeline-dot {
            position: absolute;
            left: 50%;
            top: 0;
            width: 16px;
            height: 16px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--accent-cyan);
            border: 4px solid var(--bg-primary);
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            box-shadow: var(--glow-cyan);
        }

        .timeline-content {
            padding: 2rem;
            background: var(--glass-light);
            border: 2px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            transition: all var(--transition-normal);
        }

        .timeline-content:hover {
            border-color: var(--accent-cyan);
            box-shadow: var(--glow-cyan);
        }

        .timeline-year {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .timeline-title {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            margin: 0.5rem 0;
        }

        .timeline-desc {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* ============================================================
           CONTACT SECTION
           ============================================================ */
        
        .contact-wrapper {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 4rem;
            align-items: start;
        }

        .contact-info {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 2.5rem;
        }

        .contact-item {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1.5rem;
            padding: 2rem;
            background: var(--glass-light);
            border: 2px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            transition: all var(--transition-normal);
        }

        .contact-item:hover {
            border-color: var(--accent-cyan);
            box-shadow: var(--glow-cyan);
        }

        .contact-icon {
            font-size: 2rem;
            min-width: 50px;
            text-align: center;
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
        }

        .contact-details h4 {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
        }

        .contact-details p {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
        }

        .contact-form {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 1.5rem;
            padding: 2.5rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--glass-light), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02));
            border: 2px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 16px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
        }

        .form-group {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }

        .form-group label {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }

        .form-group input,
        .form-group textarea {
            padding: 0.9rem 1.2rem;
            background: var(--glass-light);
            border: 2px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 8px;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            font-family: inherit;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            transition: all var(--transition-fast);
        }

        .form-group input::placeholder,
        .form-group textarea::placeholder {
            color: var(--text-tertiary);
        }

        .form-group input:focus,
        .form-group textarea:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: var(--accent-cyan);
            background: rgba(0, 217, 255, 0.05);
            box-shadow: var(--glow-cyan);
        }

        /* ============================================================
           TESTIMONIALS
           ============================================================ */
        
        .testimonials-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .testimonial {
            padding: 2rem;
            background: var(--glass-light);
            border: 2px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            transition: all var(--transition-normal);
        }

        .testimonial:hover {
            border-color: var(--accent-cyan);
            box-shadow: var(--glow-cyan);
        }

        .testimonial-rating {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .testimonial-text {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        .testimonial-author {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
            align-items: center;
            padding-top: 1rem;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
        }

        .author-avatar {
            width: 48px;
            height: 48px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-cyan), var(--accent-gold));
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--bg-primary);
        }

        .author-info h4 {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }

        .author-info p {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-tertiary);
        }

        /* ============================================================
           FOOTER
           ============================================================ */
        
        footer {
            background: var(--bg-secondary);
            border-top: 2px solid var(--glass-border);
            padding: 3rem 0 2rem;
            position: relative;
        }

        .footer-content {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }

        .footer-section h4 {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
        }

        .footer-section p,
        .footer-section a {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
            transition: all var(--transition-fast);
        }

        .footer-section a:hover {
            color: var(--accent-cyan);
        }

        .footer-bottom {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding-top: 2rem;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .footer-text {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: var(--text-tertiary);
        }

        .social-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .social-link {
            width: 44px;
            height: 44px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--glass-light);
            border: 2px solid var(--glass-border);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            transition: all var(--transition-fast);
        }

        .social-link:hover {
            background: var(--accent-cyan);
            border-color: var(--accent-cyan);
            color: var(--bg-primary);
            box-shadow: var(--glow-cyan);
        }

        /* ============================================================
           CURSOR GLOW EFFECT
           ============================================================ */
        
        .cursor-glow {
            position: fixed;
            width: 20px;
            height: 20px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--accent-cyan), transparent);
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 9999;
            opacity: 0.5;
        }

        /* ============================================================
           RESPONSIVE DESIGN
           ============================================================ */
        
        @media (max-width: 1024px) {
            .hero {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .about-content {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .contact-wrapper {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .section-title {
                font-size: 2.5rem;
            }

            .hero-title {
                font-size: 2.8rem;
            }

            .timeline::before {
                left: 0;
                transform: translateX(-50%);
            }

            .timeline-item {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                direction: ltr;
            }

            .timeline-dot {
                left: 0;
            }

            .footer-content {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .container {
                padding: 0 1rem;
            }

            header {
                padding: 1rem 0;
            }

            .nav-links {
                display: none;
            }

            .hamburger {
                display: flex;
            }

            .nav-links.active {
                display: flex;
                position: absolute;
                top: 70px;
                left: 0;
                right: 0;
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 1rem;
                padding: 2rem;
                background: rgba(10, 14, 39, 0.95);
                backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
                border-bottom: 2px solid var(--glass-border);
            }

            .hero-title {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }

            .section-title {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }

            .skills-grid,
            .uniform-projects-grid,
            .ui-projects-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .hero-stats {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .footer-content {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .footer-bottom {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: flex-start;
            }

            .contact-form {
                padding: 2rem;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .hero-title {
                font-size: 1.6rem;
            }

            .section-title {
                font-size: 1.5rem;
            }

            .nav-links {
                gap: 1.5rem;
            }

            .hero-cta {
                flex-direction: column;
            }

            .btn {
                width: 100%;
                justify-content: center;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <!-- Background Blob Decorations -->
    <div class="blob-decoration blob-1"></div>
    <div class="blob-decoration blob-2"></div>

    <!-- Particles Background -->
    <div class="particles">
        <div class="particle" style="top: 20%; left: 10%; animation-delay: 0s;"></div>
        <div class="particle" style="top: 40%; left: 80%; animation-delay: 1s;"></div>
        <div class="particle" style="top: 60%; left: 20%; animation-delay: 2s;"></div>
        <div class="particle" style="top: 80%; left: 70%; animation-delay: 0.5s;"></div>
        <div class="particle" style="top: 30%; left: 60%; animation-delay: 1.5s;"></div>
        <div class="particle" style="top: 70%; left: 40%; animation-delay: 2.5s;"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Cursor Glow -->
    <div class="cursor-glow"></div>

    <!-- ============================================================
         HEADER & NAVIGATION
         ============================================================ -->
    <header id="header">
        <div class="container">
            <nav>
                <div class="logo">QH</div>
                <ul class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
                    <li><a href="#home" class="nav-link active">Trang chủ</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#about" class="nav-link">Về tôi</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#skills" class="nav-link">Kỹ năng</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#uniform" class="nav-link">Đồng phục</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#ui" class="nav-link">UI/UX</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#contact" class="nav-link">Liên hệ</a></li>
                </ul>
                <div class="nav-controls">
                    <button class="theme-toggle" id="themeToggle" title="Chuyển chế độ tối/sáng">🌙</button>
                    <div class="hamburger" id="hamburger">
                        <span></span>
                        <span></span>
                        <span></span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- ============================================================
         HERO SECTION - UNIFORM DESIGNER FOCUS
         ============================================================ -->
    <section id="home" class="hero">
        <div class="floating-shape shape-1"></div>
        <div class="floating-shape shape-2"></div>

        <div class="hero-content">
            <div class="hero-subtitle">
                Uniform Designer & UX Developer
            </div>
            <h1 class="hero-title">
                Crafting <span class="highlight">beautiful uniforms</span> & digital experiences
            </h1>
            <p class="hero-description">
                I specialize in uniform design and user experience development, combining creativity with technical expertise to create professional, functional designs that make a lasting impact.
            </p>
            
            <div class="hero-stats">
                <div class="stat">
                    <div class="stat-number">1+</div>
                    <div class="stat-label">Năm kinh nghiệm</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat">
                    <div class="stat-number">Uniform</div>
                    <div class="stat-label">Designer</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat">
                    <div class="stat-number">UX/UI</div>
                    <div class="stat-label">Designer</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat">
                    <div class="stat-number">Frontend</div>
                    <div class="stat-label">Developer</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat">
                    <div class="stat-number">Adobe</div>
                    <div class="stat-label">Illustrator Expert</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat">
                    <div class="stat-number">Adobe</div>
                    <div class="stat-label">Photoshop Expert</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="hero-cta">
                <button class="btn" onclick="document.getElementById('uniform').scrollIntoView({behavior: 'smooth'})">
                    Xem thiết kế đồng phục
                </button>
                <button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="document.getElementById('contact').scrollIntoView({behavior: 'smooth'})">
                    Liên hệ ngay
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-visual">
            <div class="hero-card">👔</div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============================================================
         ABOUT SECTION
         ============================================================ -->
    <section id="about" class="dark-section reveal">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header">
                <div class="section-label">Về tôi</div>
                <h2 class="section-title">Nhà thiết kế đồng phục & UX Developer</h2>
                <p class="section-description">
                    Kết hợp nghệ thuật thiết kế với công nghệ để tạo ra những sản phẩm chất lượng cao
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="about-content">
                <div class="about-text">
                    <h3>Chuyên môn & Kinh nghiệm</h3>
                    <p>
                        Tôi là nhà thiết kế đồng phục chuyên nghiệp với niềm đam mê tạo ra những bộ trang phục đẹp mắt và chức năng. Với 1 năm kinh nghiệm thực tế, tôi đã thiết kế đồng phục cho nhiều công ty và tổ chức.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Bên cạnh đó, tôi cũng là một UX/UI Designer và Frontend Developer, có khả năng biến ý tưởng thiết kế thành sản phẩm kỹ thuật số hoàn chỉnh. Tôi tin rằng thiết kế tốt phải vừa đẹp vừa thực dụng.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Thành thạo Adobe Illustrator và Adobe Photoshop để tạo ra những thiết kế đồng phục chuyên nghiệp, kết hợp với kỹ năng UX/UI và frontend development để tạo ra trải nghiệm người dùng hoàn hảo.
                    </p>

                    <div class="about-skills">
                        <span class="skill-tag">Uniform Design</span>
                        <span class="skill-tag">UX/UI Design</span>
                        <span class="skill-tag">Adobe Illustrator</span>
                        <span class="skill-tag">Adobe Photoshop</span>
                        <span class="skill-tag">Frontend Development</span>
                        <span class="skill-tag">Branding</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="about-image">🎨</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============================================================
         SKILLS SECTION - DESIGNER FOCUSED
         ============================================================ -->
    <section id="skills" class="reveal">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header">
                <div class="section-label">Kỹ năng</div>
                <h2 class="section-title">Công cụ & kỹ năng chuyên môn</h2>
                <p class="section-description">
                    Bộ công cụ đa dạng để tạo ra những thiết kế đồng phục và trải nghiệm kỹ thuật số xuất sắc
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="skills-grid">
                <div class="skill-card reveal">
                    <div class="skill-icon">👔</div>
                    <div class="skill-name">Uniform Design</div>
